the n0 is saturator
the n1 is attenuverter samplerate=half offset=0.945
the n2 is harmonics att.pitch=0.27
the n3 is switch samplerate=quarter
the n4 is trigdelay
the n5 is filterbank band8=0.549
n1 -> n0
n0 -> n0.burst
button1 => n1.amount
n2.h3 -50> n1.offset
n4 -> n2
n1 ~> n3
n0 -35> n3.in2
n4 -> n3.in3
n2.h2 ?> n3.next
n4 -> n3.next
n1 -> n3.reset
n0 -> n4.time
n3 ~> n5
n2.h2 -> n5
n4 -> n5.band5
n4 -> n5.band5
n4 -> n5.band6
n1 -> n5.band6
n5 ?> n5.band8
n4 -> n5.band8
n1 -> out
n0 -> out
n3 -> right
